@tradition night-owls-cocoa
// Night owls' cocoa (FX14, 0.92.5 item 16; SW1's pitch): Saturday late, after film night and the observatory, Davi Keane
// makes a big pot of cocoa in the bow lounge with the lights down low. Behind WEEKEND_ON.
k: 463
title: Night owls' cocoa
when: weekly saturday
at: 22:30-23:30
min: 20
jitter: 15
where: 3 room Bow lounge: lounge-seat, bench
hold: 1
who: keane-davi always, night-owl 80%, late-sleeper 50%, stargazer 30%, everyone 8%
anim: drink
host: keane-davi
from: keane-davi

== mail
- Night owls' cocoa tomorrow from half ten, bow lounge. Lights low, cocoa high. Pyjamas welcome.

== ask
- Cocoa in the bow lounge later? For those of us who don't sleep.
- Night owls' cocoa tonight. Keane's making the big pot.

== here
- Mind the pot, it's hot. Like the conversation.   #funny
- Look at those stars. Nobody sees them this late but us.

== thanks
- You sit with a mug of Keane's cocoa in the low light of the bow lounge, the curved windows full of stars.

== chatter
- Night owls' cocoa tonight. The best hour of the week, if you can stay up.
